---
// /disclaimer/ — Disclaimer & Legal Notice
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-10-29';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | YT Playlist Cal"
  description="Disclaimer and legal notice for YT Playlist Cal — trademark attribution, calculation accuracy, YouTube API limitations, and terms of use for our YouTube playlist calculator."
  noindex={false}
>
  <Header />
  <main class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="container content-width">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
          <li><a href="/" style="color: var(--color-text-muted); text-decoration: none;">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true">›</li>
          <li aria-current="page" style="color: var(--color-text);">Disclaimer</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text); letter-spacing: -0.03em;">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-sm mb-8" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="prose-content space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">

        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border text-sm" style="background-color: var(--color-surface); border-color: var(--color-border); color: var(--color-text);">
          <strong>Summary:</strong> YT Playlist Cal is an independent, free utility tool. We are not affiliated with, authorized by, or endorsed by YouTube or Google LLC. All calculations and estimations are provided on an "as is" basis for informational planning purposes.
        </div>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">1. Trademark and Brand Affiliation</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>YouTube™</strong>, the YouTube logo, and related marks and trade dress are registered trademarks of <strong>Google LLC</strong> (or Alphabet Inc.). All other trademarks, service marks, logos, and product names appearing on this website are the property of their respective owners.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            YT Playlist Cal is an independent web application and is <strong>not affiliated with, associated with, authorized by, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with YouTube, Google LLC, Alphabet Inc., or any of their subsidiaries or affiliates</strong>. Reference to any specific third-party company, product, trademark, service, or URL does not constitute or imply an endorsement, recommendation, or sponsorship by that entity.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">2. Nature of the Tool & Informational Purposes Only</h2>
          <p>
            The services, calculations, durations, speed estimations, watch planner schedules, and all related content provided on YT Playlist Cal are offered solely for <strong>general informational, educational, and personal planning purposes</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            The results generated by our calculator should not be relied upon as an official audit, contractually binding measurement, academic completion certification, or technical proof of video duration. You should independently verify playlist and video lengths if you have strict deadlines, academic requirements, or commercial commitments.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">3. Accuracy and Completeness of Calculations</h2>
          <p>
            While we strive to ensure that all calculations are accurate and mathematically sound, calculations are dependent upon metadata returned by third-party services (specifically the YouTube Data API v3). We make no representations or warranties regarding the absolute accuracy, completeness, timeliness, or reliability of any calculated results.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Discrepancies in total duration, video counts, or speed-adjusted watch times may arise due to factors beyond our control, including:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>Unavailable Videos:</strong> Videos in a playlist that are private, deleted, country-restricted, region-blocked, age-gated, or copyright-claimed return no duration metadata from the API and are excluded from the calculated total.</li>
            <li><strong>Live Streams & Premieres:</strong> Live streams or active broadcasts do not report definitive video durations while streaming or during post-processing by YouTube.</li>
            <li><strong>Dynamic Playlist Updates:</strong> Playlists modified or reordered by creators during or between calculations may produce differing totals.</li>
            <li><strong>Playback Speed Approximations:</strong> Mathematical division by playback speed factors (e.g., 1.25×, 1.5×, 1.75×, 2×) provides theoretical watch time. Actual viewing time may vary based on player buffering, intro/outro skipping, pauses, ad playback, or variable video playback frame rates.</li>
            <li><strong>API Metadata Inconsistencies:</strong> The YouTube Data API provides video duration in ISO 8601 duration format (e.g., <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs" style="background-color: var(--color-surface-2);">PT1H2M10S</code>). Any rounding or metadata discrepancies within YouTube's own systems are reflected in our outputs.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">4. Third-Party Services & API Usage</h2>
          <p>
            YT Playlist Cal relies on the <strong>YouTube Data API v3</strong> to retrieve public playlist and video metadata. By using this tool, you acknowledge that:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1.5">
            <li>Your requests to calculate playlists are governed by YouTube's terms and developer policies. By interacting with content derived from YouTube, users may be subject to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--color-text); text-decoration: underline;">YouTube Terms of Service</a> and Google's policies.</li>
            <li>Tool availability is subject to YouTube API quotas, rate limiting, and server status. We do not guarantee uninterrupted access or service uptime.</li>
            <li>If you choose to use an optional personal YouTube API key in the advanced settings, it is used exclusively to facilitate your request and is discarded immediately after execution without being stored or logged. However, you are solely responsible for managing your own API quota and credentials in accordance with Google Cloud Terms of Service.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">5. External Links Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            YT Playlist Cal may contain links to external third-party websites, documentation, and resources that are not provided, maintained, or in any way controlled by YT Playlist Cal. We do not endorse, guarantee, or assume responsibility for the accuracy, relevance, timeliness, or completeness of any information on external sites. Clicking external links is done at your own risk.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">6. "As Is" and "As Available" Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            YT PLAYLIST CAL AND ALL CONTENT, CALCULATORS, TOOLS, AND FUNCTIONALITY PROVIDED HEREIN ARE DISTRIBUTED ON AN <strong>"AS IS"</strong> AND <strong>"AS AVAILABLE"</strong> BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS, IMPLIED, STATUTORY, OR OTHERWISE.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMISSIBLE UNDER APPLICABLE LAW, WE DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, ACCURACY, AND FREEDOM FROM COMPUTER VIRUSES OR OTHER HARMFUL COMPONENTS. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE SERVICE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, TIMELY, SECURE, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE FROM DATA LOSS.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL YT PLAYLIST CAL, ITS AUTHORS, MAINTAINERS, AFFILIATES, OR HOSTING PROVIDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES ARISING FROM:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1.5">
            <li>Your use of, or inability to use, this website or its calculation tools;</li>
            <li>Any inaccuracies, errors, omissions, or delays in duration results, watch schedules, or metadata;</li>
            <li>Any decisions made, deadlines missed, or actions taken in reliance upon the outputs produced by this tool;</li>
            <li>Any unauthorized access, technical failure, server downtime, or interruption in service.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Your sole and exclusive remedy for dissatisfaction with the site or its services is to cease using the website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">8. Revisions and Modifications</h2>
          <p>
            We may update, modify, or revise this Disclaimer at any time without prior notice. Any updates will be effective immediately upon publication on this page, with the revised date indicated at the top. Your continued use of YT Playlist Cal following the posting of changes constitutes your acceptance of such modifications.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text);">9. Contact and Questions</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions, feedback, or concerns regarding this Disclaimer or the operation of the tool, please contact us via our <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--color-text); text-decoration: underline;">Contact Page</a> or review our <a href="/faq/" style="color: var(--color-text); text-decoration: underline;">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

